---
import ArticleLayout from '../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro';
import { PUBLISHER } from '../consts';
---

<ArticleLayout
  title="Delete your account"
  description="How to permanently delete your Cortisol+ account and all associated data — directly in the app, or by request if you've uninstalled. Processed within 30 days."
  updated="2026-07-18"
  hideDisclaimer={true}
>
  <p>
    This page explains how to permanently delete your <strong>Cortisol+</strong> account and all data
    associated with it. Cortisol+ is published by <strong>{PUBLISHER.legalName}</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>Delete your account in the app (recommended)</h2>
  <p>
    If you still have Cortisol+ installed, you can delete your account and all of its data yourself in
    a few taps:
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open <strong>Cortisol+</strong>.</li>
    <li>Tap <strong>Settings</strong> (the gear icon, top-right).</li>
    <li>Tap <strong>Account</strong>.</li>
    <li>Tap <strong>Delete Account &amp; Data</strong>.</li>
    <li>Confirm by choosing <strong>Delete Everything</strong>.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    This <strong>permanently erases your account and all associated data</strong>. The action is immediate
    and cannot be undone.
  </p>

  <h2>Deleted your app already? Request deletion by email</h2>
  <p>
    If you've uninstalled Cortisol+ and can no longer reach the in-app option, email us and we'll delete
    your account for you:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${PUBLISHER.email}?subject=Delete%20My%20Account`}>{PUBLISHER.email}</a></li>
    <li><strong>Subject:</strong> Delete My Account</li>
    <li><strong>Include:</strong> the username on your Cortisol+ account, so we can locate and verify it.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We will process your request and permanently delete your account and data within <strong>30 days</strong>
    of receiving it.
  </p>

  <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
  <p>
    Deleting your account permanently removes <strong>all</strong> of your personal data from our systems,
    including:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your profile and username</li>
    <li>Health and fitness data synced to the Cortisol+ cloud (cortisol scores, HRV, sleep, and related metrics)</li>
    <li>Walks and activity records</li>
    <li>Social posts, friend connections, and interactions</li>
    <li>Support messages and conversation history</li>
    <li>Your account credentials and authentication identifiers</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    <strong>Nothing is retained for marketing.</strong> We do not keep a copy of your personal data to
    contact you or advertise to you after deletion.
  </p>

  <h2>What is not kept</h2>
  <p>
    Once your account is deleted, your personal data is gone. We do not retain profile, health, social,
    or support data beyond deletion, except where a narrow legal or tax obligation requires keeping a
    limited transaction record (for example, subscription billing records held by Apple or Google), which
    never includes your health data. Any anonymized, aggregated analytics that cannot be tied back to you
    are not personal data and are unaffected.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Data that has already been removed cannot be recovered.</strong> If you want a copy of your
    information, request it before deleting your account by emailing
    <a href={`mailto:${PUBLISHER.email}`}>{PUBLISHER.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    For any question about deleting your account or your data, contact
    <a href={`mailto:${PUBLISHER.email}`}>{PUBLISHER.email}</a>.<br/>
    <strong>App:</strong> Cortisol+<br/>
    <strong>Developer:</strong> {PUBLISHER.legalName}
  </p>
</ArticleLayout>
